{
  "$comment": "Shared accept/reject cases for the Target Repository URL pattern. Asserted by both backend/tests/test_github.py (parse_repo_url) and frontend/tests/repo-url.test.ts (parseRepoUrl) so the two can never silently disagree about what they accept. See issue #42.",
